[
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 0,
    "text": "CHAPTER VI. Pig and Pepper",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "",
    "trailing_silence_s": 1.0,
    "start_s": 0.0,
    "end_s": 2.8,
    "duration_s": 2.8,
    "title": true
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 1,
    "text": "For a minute or two she stood looking at the house, and wondering what to do next, when suddenly a footman in livery came running out of the wood—(she considered him to be a footman because he was in livery: otherwise, judging by his face only, she would have called him a fish)—and rapped loudly at the door with his knuckles. It was opened by another footman in livery, with a round face, and large eyes like a frog; and both footmen, Alice noticed, had powdered hair that curled all over their heads. She felt very curious to know what it was all about, and crept a little way out of the wood to listen.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 2.8,
    "end_s": 36.44,
    "duration_s": 33.64
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 2,
    "text": "The Fish-Footman began by producing from under his arm a great letter, nearly as large as himself, and this he handed over to the other.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 36.44,
    "end_s": 44.26,
    "duration_s": 7.82
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FISH_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 3,
    "text": "For the Duchess. An invitation from the Queen to play croquet.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "solemn, formal",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 44.26,
    "end_s": 48.139184,
    "duration_s": 3.879184
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 4,
    "text": "From the Queen. An invitation for the Duchess to play croquet.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "solemn, formal",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 48.139184,
    "end_s": 52.540817000000004,
    "duration_s": 4.401633
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 5,
    "text": "Then they both bowed low, and their curls got entangled together. Alice laughed so much at this, that she had to run back into the wood for fear of their hearing her; and when she next peeped out the Fish-Footman was gone, and the other was sitting on the ground near the door, staring stupidly up into the sky. Alice went timidly up to the door, and knocked.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative, lightly amused",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 52.540817000000004,
    "end_s": 72.860817,
    "duration_s": 20.32
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 6,
    "text": "There’s no sort of use in knocking, and that for two reasons. First, because I’m on the same side of the door as you are; secondly, because they’re making such a noise inside, no one could possibly hear you.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dull, matter-of-fact",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 72.860817,
    "end_s": 86.065715,
    "duration_s": 13.204898
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 7,
    "text": "And certainly there was a most extraordinary noise going on within—a constant howling and sneezing, and every now and then a great crash, as if a dish or kettle had been broken to pieces.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 86.065715,
    "end_s": 96.585715,
    "duration_s": 10.52
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 8,
    "text": "Please, then, how am I to get in?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, confused",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 96.585715,
    "end_s": 98.765806,
    "duration_s": 2.180091
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 9,
    "text": "There might be some sense in your knocking, if we had the door between us. For instance, if you were inside, you might knock, and I could let you out, you know.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dull, philosophical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 98.765806,
    "end_s": 108.574786,
    "duration_s": 9.80898
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 10,
    "text": "He was looking up into the sky all the time he was speaking.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 108.574786,
    "end_s": 111.47544400000001,
    "duration_s": 2.900658
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 11,
    "text": "But perhaps he can’t help it; his eyes are so very nearly at the top of his head.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 111.47544400000001,
    "end_s": 115.58973,
    "duration_s": 4.114286
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 12,
    "text": "But at any rate he might answer questions.—How am I to get in?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "loud, impatient",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 115.58973,
    "end_s": 119.170886,
    "duration_s": 3.581156
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 13,
    "text": "I shall sit here, till tomorrow—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dull, unbothered",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 119.170886,
    "end_s": 121.56109,
    "duration_s": 2.390204
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 14,
    "text": "At this moment the door of the house opened, and a large plate came skimming out, straight at the Footman’s head: it just grazed his nose, and broke to pieces against one of the trees behind him.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative, sudden",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 121.56109,
    "end_s": 131.474559,
    "duration_s": 9.913469
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 15,
    "text": "—or next day, maybe.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dull, uninterrupted",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 131.474559,
    "end_s": 133.601226,
    "duration_s": 2.126667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 16,
    "text": "How am I to get in?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "louder, frustrated",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 133.601226,
    "end_s": 135.136215,
    "duration_s": 1.534989
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 17,
    "text": "Are you to get in at all? That’s the first question, you know.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "philosophical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 135.136215,
    "end_s": 138.33621499999998,
    "duration_s": 3.2
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 18,
    "text": "It was, no doubt: only Alice did not like to be told so.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 138.33621499999998,
    "end_s": 141.27621499999998,
    "duration_s": 2.94
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 19,
    "text": "It’s really dreadful, the way all the creatures argue. It’s enough to drive one crazy!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought, muttered",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 141.27621499999998,
    "end_s": 146.27174799999997,
    "duration_s": 4.995533
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 20,
    "text": "The Footman seemed to think this a good opportunity for repeating his remark, with variations.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 146.27174799999997,
    "end_s": 151.17174799999998,
    "duration_s": 4.9
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 21,
    "text": "I shall sit here, on and off, for days and days.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dull",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 151.17174799999998,
    "end_s": 155.59950299999997,
    "duration_s": 4.427755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 22,
    "text": "But what am I to do?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "desperate",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 155.59950299999997,
    "end_s": 157.02267799999996,
    "duration_s": 1.423175
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "FROG_FOOTMAN",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 23,
    "text": "Anything you like.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "casual",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 157.02267799999996,
    "end_s": 158.32986599999995,
    "duration_s": 1.307188
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 24,
    "text": "He began whistling.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 158.32986599999995,
    "end_s": 159.56986599999996,
    "duration_s": 1.24
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 25,
    "text": "Oh, there’s no use in talking to him: he’s perfectly idiotic!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "desperate, annoyed",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 159.56986599999996,
    "end_s": 162.87435599999995,
    "duration_s": 3.30449
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_EXT",
    "ordinal": 26,
    "text": "And she opened the door and went in.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 162.87435599999995,
    "end_s": 165.21435599999995,
    "duration_s": 2.34
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 27,
    "text": "The door led right into a large kitchen, which was full of smoke from one end to the other: the Duchess was sitting on a three-legged stool in the middle, nursing a baby; the cook was leaning over the fire, stirring a large cauldron which seemed to be full of soup.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 165.21435599999995,
    "end_s": 179.09435599999995,
    "duration_s": 13.88
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 28,
    "text": "There’s certainly too much pepper in that soup!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought, sneezing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 179.09435599999995,
    "end_s": 181.74260999999996,
    "duration_s": 2.648254
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 29,
    "text": "There was certainly too much of it in the air. Even the Duchess sneezed occasionally; and as for the baby, it was sneezing and howling alternately without a moment’s pause. The only things in the kitchen that did not sneeze, were the cook, and a large cat which was sitting on the hearth and grinning from ear to ear.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 181.74260999999996,
    "end_s": 199.24260999999996,
    "duration_s": 17.5
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 30,
    "text": "Please would you tell me, why your cat grins like that?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "timid, polite",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 199.24260999999996,
    "end_s": 202.23362999999995,
    "duration_s": 2.99102
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 31,
    "text": "It’s a Cheshire cat, and that’s why.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "gruff",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 202.23362999999995,
    "end_s": 204.64029699999995,
    "duration_s": 2.406667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 32,
    "text": "Pig!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "shouting, violent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 204.64029699999995,
    "end_s": 205.35866399999995,
    "duration_s": 0.718367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 33,
    "text": "She said the last word with such sudden violence that Alice quite jumped; but she saw in another moment that it was addressed to the baby, and not to her, so she took courage, and went on again.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 205.35866399999995,
    "end_s": 216.11866399999994,
    "duration_s": 10.76
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 34,
    "text": "I didn’t know that Cheshire cats always grinned; in fact, I didn’t know that cats could grin.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, informative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 216.11866399999994,
    "end_s": 220.67703099999994,
    "duration_s": 4.558367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 35,
    "text": "They all can; and most of ’em do.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hoarse, dismissive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 220.67703099999994,
    "end_s": 223.26421899999994,
    "duration_s": 2.587188
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 36,
    "text": "I don’t know of any that do.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, pleased",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 223.26421899999994,
    "end_s": 224.81455899999995,
    "duration_s": 1.55034
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 37,
    "text": "You don’t know much; and that’s a fact.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "blunt, rude",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 224.81455899999995,
    "end_s": 227.54122599999994,
    "duration_s": 2.726667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 38,
    "text": "Alice did not at all like the tone of this remark, and thought it would be as well to introduce some other subject of conversation. While she was trying to fix on one, the cook took the cauldron of soup off the fire, and at once set to work throwing everything within her reach at the Duchess and the baby—the fire-irons came first; then followed a shower of saucepans, plates, and dishes. The Duchess took no notice of them even when they hit her; and the baby was howling so much already, that it was quite impossible to say whether the blows hurt it or not.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative, chaotic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 227.54122599999994,
    "end_s": 258.92122599999993,
    "duration_s": 31.38
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 39,
    "text": "Oh, please mind what you’re doing! Oh, there goes his precious nose!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "terrified, shouting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 258.92122599999993,
    "end_s": 262.48693999999995,
    "duration_s": 3.565714
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 40,
    "text": "An unusually large saucepan flew close by it, and very nearly carried it off.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 262.48693999999995,
    "end_s": 266.7669399999999,
    "duration_s": 4.28
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 41,
    "text": "If everybody minded their own business, the world would go round a deal faster than it does.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hoarse growl",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 266.7669399999999,
    "end_s": 271.97836899999993,
    "duration_s": 5.211429
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 42,
    "text": "Which would not be an advantage. Just think of what work it would make with the day and night! You see the earth takes twenty-four hours to turn round on its axis—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "knowledgeable, academic",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 271.97836899999993,
    "end_s": 279.33183799999995,
    "duration_s": 7.353469
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 43,
    "text": "Talking of axes, chop off her head!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "violent, shouting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 279.33183799999995,
    "end_s": 281.852654,
    "duration_s": 2.520816
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 44,
    "text": "Alice glanced rather anxiously at the cook, to see if she meant to take the hint; but the cook was busily stirring the soup, and seemed not to be listening, so she went on again.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 281.852654,
    "end_s": 291.25265399999995,
    "duration_s": 9.4
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 45,
    "text": "Twenty-four hours, I think; or is it twelve? I—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "hesitant",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 291.25265399999995,
    "end_s": 295.92102099999994,
    "duration_s": 4.668367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 46,
    "text": "Oh, don’t bother me; I never could abide figures!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "annoyed, dismissive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 295.92102099999994,
    "end_s": 298.80755199999993,
    "duration_s": 2.886531
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 47,
    "text": "And with that she began nursing her child again, singing a sort of lullaby to it as she did so, and giving it a violent shake at the end of every line:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 298.80755199999993,
    "end_s": 307.48755199999994,
    "duration_s": 8.68
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 48,
    "text": "Speak roughly to your little boy, And beat him when he sneezes: He only does it to annoy, Because he knows it teases.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "singing, hoarse, violent",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 307.48755199999994,
    "end_s": 314.97421899999995,
    "duration_s": 7.486667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_COOK",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 49,
    "text": "Wow! wow! wow!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "singing, flat",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 314.97421899999995,
    "end_s": 317.9408859999999,
    "duration_s": 2.966667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 50,
    "text": "While the Duchess sang the second verse of the song, she kept tossing the baby violently up and down, and the poor little thing howled so, that Alice could hardly hear the words:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 317.9408859999999,
    "end_s": 328.18088599999993,
    "duration_s": 10.24
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 51,
    "text": "I speak severely to my boy, I beat him when he sneezes; For he can thoroughly enjoy The pepper when he pleases!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "singing, hoarse",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 328.18088599999993,
    "end_s": 335.1686409999999,
    "duration_s": 6.987755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_COOK",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 52,
    "text": "Wow! wow! wow!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "singing, hoarse",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 335.1686409999999,
    "end_s": 338.45530799999995,
    "duration_s": 3.286667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "THE_DUCHESS",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 53,
    "text": "Here! you may nurse it a bit, if you like! I must go and get ready to play croquet with the Queen.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "abrupt, shouting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 338.45530799999995,
    "end_s": 344.16306299999997,
    "duration_s": 5.707755
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 54,
    "text": "She hurried out of the room. The cook threw a frying-pan after her as she went out, but it just missed her. Alice caught the baby with some difficulty, as it was a queer-shaped little creature, and held out its arms and legs in all directions.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 344.16306299999997,
    "end_s": 357.72306299999997,
    "duration_s": 13.56
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 55,
    "text": "Just like a star-fish.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 357.72306299999997,
    "end_s": 359.120614,
    "duration_s": 1.397551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_DUCHESS_KITCHEN",
    "ordinal": 56,
    "text": "The poor little thing was snorting like a steam-engine when she caught it, and kept doubling itself up and straightening itself out again, so that altogether, for the first minute or two, it was as much as she could do to hold it.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 359.120614,
    "end_s": 371.98591999999996,
    "duration_s": 12.865306
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 57,
    "text": "As soon as she had made out the proper way of nursing it, (which was to twist it up into a sort of knot, and then keep tight hold of its right ear and left foot, so as to prevent its undoing itself,) she carried it out into the open air.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 371.98591999999996,
    "end_s": 385.86591999999996,
    "duration_s": 13.88
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 58,
    "text": "If I don’t take this child away with me, they’re sure to kill it in a day or two: wouldn’t it be murder to leave it behind?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought then spoken",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 385.86591999999996,
    "end_s": 391.70428699999997,
    "duration_s": 5.838367
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 59,
    "text": "The little thing grunted in reply (it had left off sneezing by this time).",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 391.70428699999997,
    "end_s": 395.60428699999994,
    "duration_s": 3.9
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 60,
    "text": "Don’t grunt; that’s not at all a proper way of expressing yourself.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "firm, admonishing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 395.60428699999994,
    "end_s": 399.0132669999999,
    "duration_s": 3.40898
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 61,
    "text": "The baby grunted again, and Alice looked very anxiously into its face to see what was the matter with it. There could be no doubt that it had a very turn-up nose, much more like a snout than a real nose; also its eyes were getting extremely small for a baby: altogether Alice did not like the look of the thing at all.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 399.0132669999999,
    "end_s": 416.7732669999999,
    "duration_s": 17.76
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 62,
    "text": "But perhaps it was only sobbing.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 416.7732669999999,
    "end_s": 418.3014299999999,
    "duration_s": 1.528163
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 63,
    "text": "She looked into its eyes again, to see if there were any tears. No, there were no tears.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 418.3014299999999,
    "end_s": 423.46142999999995,
    "duration_s": 5.16
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 64,
    "text": "If you’re going to turn into a pig, my dear, I’ll have nothing more to do with you. Mind now!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "serious, warning",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 423.46142999999995,
    "end_s": 428.30553399999997,
    "duration_s": 4.844104
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 65,
    "text": "The poor little thing sobbed again (or grunted, it was impossible to say which), and they went on for some while in silence. Alice was just beginning to think to herself:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 428.30553399999997,
    "end_s": 437.70553399999994,
    "duration_s": 9.4
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 66,
    "text": "Now, what am I to do with this creature when I get it home?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 437.70553399999994,
    "end_s": 440.67043199999995,
    "duration_s": 2.964898
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 67,
    "text": "When it grunted again, so violently, that she looked down into its face in some alarm. This time there could be no mistake about it: it was neither more nor less than a pig, and she felt that it would be quite absurd for her to carry it further. So she set the little creature down, and felt quite relieved to see it trot away quietly into the wood.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 440.67043199999995,
    "end_s": 459.46553399999993,
    "duration_s": 18.795102
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 68,
    "text": "If it had grown up, it would have made a dreadfully ugly child: but it makes rather a handsome pig, I think.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 459.46553399999993,
    "end_s": 465.1210439999999,
    "duration_s": 5.65551
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 69,
    "text": "If one only knew the right way to change them—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 465.1210439999999,
    "end_s": 467.8207269999999,
    "duration_s": 2.699683
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 70,
    "text": "She was a little startled by seeing the Cheshire Cat sitting on a bough of a tree a few yards off. The Cat only grinned when it saw Alice. It looked good-natured, she thought: still it had very long claws and a great many teeth, so she felt that it ought to be treated with respect.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 467.8207269999999,
    "end_s": 483.3505229999999,
    "duration_s": 15.529796
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 71,
    "text": "Cheshire Puss, would you tell me, please, which way I ought to go from here?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "timid, polite",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 483.3505229999999,
    "end_s": 487.5431759999999,
    "duration_s": 4.192653
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 72,
    "text": "It only grinned a little wider.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 487.5431759999999,
    "end_s": 489.2431759999999,
    "duration_s": 1.7
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 73,
    "text": "Come, it’s pleased so far.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 489.2431759999999,
    "end_s": 490.9541959999999,
    "duration_s": 1.71102
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 74,
    "text": "That depends a good deal on where you want to get to.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "smooth, calm",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 490.9541959999999,
    "end_s": 493.5808629999999,
    "duration_s": 2.626667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 75,
    "text": "I don’t much care where—",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "uncertain",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 493.5808629999999,
    "end_s": 495.0690259999999,
    "duration_s": 1.488163
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 76,
    "text": "Then it doesn’t matter which way you go.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "smooth, dismissive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 495.0690259999999,
    "end_s": 497.1196379999999,
    "duration_s": 2.050612
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 77,
    "text": "—so long as I get somewhere.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "explanatory",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 497.1196379999999,
    "end_s": 498.8214069999999,
    "duration_s": 1.701769
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 78,
    "text": "Oh, you’re sure to do that, if you only walk long enough.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "reassuring, philosophical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 498.8214069999999,
    "end_s": 502.67446799999993,
    "duration_s": 3.853061
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 79,
    "text": "Alice felt that this could not be denied, so she tried another question.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 502.67446799999993,
    "end_s": 506.5144679999999,
    "duration_s": 3.84
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 80,
    "text": "What sort of people live about here?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "curious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 506.5144679999999,
    "end_s": 508.2516109999999,
    "duration_s": 1.737143
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 81,
    "text": "In that direction lives a Hatter: and in that direction lives a March Hare. Visit either you like: they’re both mad.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "informative, casual",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 508.2516109999999,
    "end_s": 514.4818149999999,
    "duration_s": 6.230204
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 82,
    "text": "But I don’t want to go among mad people.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "concerned",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 514.4818149999999,
    "end_s": 516.7414069999999,
    "duration_s": 2.259592
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 83,
    "text": "Oh, you can’t help that: we’re all mad here. I’m mad. You’re mad.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "matter-of-fact",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 516.7414069999999,
    "end_s": 521.4042639999999,
    "duration_s": 4.662857
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 84,
    "text": "How do you know I’m mad?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "skeptical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 521.4042639999999,
    "end_s": 522.9167359999999,
    "duration_s": 1.512472
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 85,
    "text": "You must be, or you wouldn’t have come here.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "logical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 522.9167359999999,
    "end_s": 525.0457159999999,
    "duration_s": 2.12898
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 86,
    "text": "Alice didn’t think that proved it at all; however, she went on.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 525.0457159999999,
    "end_s": 528.4457159999998,
    "duration_s": 3.4
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 87,
    "text": "And how do you know that you’re mad?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "inquisitive",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 528.4457159999998,
    "end_s": 530.2989129999999,
    "duration_s": 1.853197
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 88,
    "text": "To begin with, a dog’s not mad. You grant that?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "logical, engaging",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 530.2989129999999,
    "end_s": 533.6817699999998,
    "duration_s": 3.382857
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 89,
    "text": "I suppose so.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "agreeing",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 533.6817699999998,
    "end_s": 534.9049449999998,
    "duration_s": 1.223175
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 90,
    "text": "Well, then, you see, a dog growls when it’s angry, and wags its tail when it’s pleased. Now I growl when I’m pleased, and wag my tail when I’m angry. Therefore I’m mad.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "explanatory, logical",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 534.9049449999998,
    "end_s": 545.5716119999997,
    "duration_s": 10.666667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 91,
    "text": "I call it purring, not growling.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "correcting",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 545.5716119999997,
    "end_s": 547.8312039999997,
    "duration_s": 2.259592
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 92,
    "text": "Call it what you like. Do you play croquet with the Queen to-day?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "dismissive, inquiring",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 547.8312039999997,
    "end_s": 551.3707959999997,
    "duration_s": 3.539592
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 93,
    "text": "I should like it very much, but I haven’t been invited yet.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "polite, regretful",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 551.3707959999997,
    "end_s": 555.0033809999996,
    "duration_s": 3.632585
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 94,
    "text": "You’ll see me there.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "mysterious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 555.0033809999996,
    "end_s": 556.1658299999997,
    "duration_s": 1.162449
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 95,
    "text": "And the Cat vanished. Alice was not much surprised at this, she was getting so used to queer things happening. While she was looking at the place where it had been, it suddenly appeared again.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 556.1658299999997,
    "end_s": 567.3458299999996,
    "duration_s": 11.18
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 96,
    "text": "By-the-bye, what became of the baby? I’d nearly forgotten to ask.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "casual, curious",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 567.3458299999996,
    "end_s": 571.5384829999996,
    "duration_s": 4.192653
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 97,
    "text": "It turned into a pig.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "quiet, matter-of-fact",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 571.5384829999996,
    "end_s": 573.0130859999996,
    "duration_s": 1.474603
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 98,
    "text": "I thought it would.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "unsurprised",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 573.0130859999996,
    "end_s": 574.0449229999996,
    "duration_s": 1.031837
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 99,
    "text": "And the Cat vanished again. Alice waited a little, half expecting to see it again, but it did not appear, and after a minute or two she walked on in the direction in which the March Hare was said to live.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 574.0449229999996,
    "end_s": 585.7049229999996,
    "duration_s": 11.66
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 100,
    "text": "I’ve seen hatters before; the March Hare will be much the most interesting, and perhaps as this is May it won’t be raving mad—at least not so mad as it was in March.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 585.7049229999996,
    "end_s": 594.5996169999995,
    "duration_s": 8.894694
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 101,
    "text": "As she said this, she looked up, and there was the Cat again, sitting on a branch of a tree.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 594.5996169999995,
    "end_s": 599.5196169999995,
    "duration_s": 4.92
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 102,
    "text": "Did you say pig, or fig?",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "calm, inquiring",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.2,
    "start_s": 599.5196169999995,
    "end_s": 601.4918619999995,
    "duration_s": 1.972245
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 103,
    "text": "I said pig; and I wish you wouldn’t keep appearing and vanishing so suddenly: you make one quite giddy.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "annoyed",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 601.4918619999995,
    "end_s": 606.9122699999995,
    "duration_s": 5.420408
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "CHESHIRE_CAT",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 104,
    "text": "All right.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "obliging",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.1,
    "start_s": 606.9122699999995,
    "end_s": 607.6389369999995,
    "duration_s": 0.726667
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 105,
    "text": "And this time it vanished quite slowly, beginning with the end of the tail, and ending with the grin, which remained some time after the rest of it had gone.",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 607.6389369999995,
    "end_s": 616.3768959999995,
    "duration_s": 8.737959
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 106,
    "text": "Well! I’ve often seen a cat without a grin; but a grin without a cat! It’s the most curious thing I ever saw in my life!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought, amazed",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.3,
    "start_s": 616.3768959999995,
    "end_s": 623.2079159999995,
    "duration_s": 6.83102
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "NARRATOR",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 107,
    "text": "She had not gone much farther before she came in sight of the house of the March Hare: she thought it must be the right house, because the chimneys were shaped like ears and the roof was thatched with fur. It was so large a house, that she did not like to go nearer till she had nibbled some more of the lefthand bit of mushroom, and raised herself to about two feet high: even then she walked up towards it rather timidly, saying to herself:",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "narrative",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.4,
    "start_s": 623.2079159999995,
    "end_s": 648.3246509999994,
    "duration_s": 25.116735
  },
  {
    "character_identifier": "ALICE",
    "scene_identifier": "SCENE_WOOD_PATH",
    "ordinal": 108,
    "text": "Suppose it should be raving mad after all! I almost wish I’d gone to see the Hatter instead!",
    "speed": 1.0,
    "audio_description": "internal thought, hesitant",
    "trailing_silence_s": 0.5,
    "start_s": 648.3246509999994,
    "end_s": 654.1368959999994,
    "duration_s": 5.812245
  }
]